- Read-only Java 5.5.1 source review confirmed `NettyRemotingClient.start()`
  reads `NettyClientConfig.getClientWorkerThreads()` when it creates the
  `DefaultEventExecutorGroup`. Values changed after client construction and
  before start therefore affect the created worker group.
